+// Runmode: kernel
+// Testidea: Exec with one DT_NEEDED; both images mapped, GOT points at lib.
+/* Pseudocode: build libfoo.so + exec needing it; run loader; assert both
+   mapped and GOT entry == lib symbol VA. */
